    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "אגלה אזנך",
      "rationale": "Ḥiri: 'ad d-mlen i yimeẓẓuɣ-ik' — 'ad rmlen ameẓẓuɣ-ik' mačči d talɣa n teqbaylit; unamek: ad k-inweɣ."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "גאל",
      "rationale": "Aẓar gaal yettaller-d kuẓ tikal deg tseddart-agi (תגאל, גאל, יגאל, לגאול, אגאל) — asmiggel n tezmert n usekket, ur yuli ara akk deg tsuqilt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "ואדע \/ יגאל",
      "rationale": "Ketiv war waw: 'ad ẓreɣ' neɣ 'ad iẓer'; JPS tettekki deg 'ma ur yettwasukkit ara' (yiqtol n tidet) ma d KJV 'ma terbɣiḍ ara ur tessukkit'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "Boaz ɣer ueğreb",
      "rationale": "Awal-agi yettwalmas s tulsa ɣer usekker (goel), deg teẓgi n wid yettawḍen d yimɣaren n wegdud."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Yerna qqareɣ: ad d-mlen i yimeẓẓuɣ-ik, ini: t-ɣ deg uẓir n yimezdaɣ, d deg uẓir n yimɣaren n wegdud-iw. Ma tessukkteḍ-t, ssukket-it; ma ur tessukkit ara, ini-yi-d, iwakken ad ẓreɣ; axaṭer ulac win beṛṛa n kečč ara isukken, yerna nekki deffir-ik. Inna: Nekki, ad isukkeɣ.",
